WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.876 --> 00:00:01.835
Mr. Turner?

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:08.008
You will burn like the rest.

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:14.806
It's been three months.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:19.186
If the rest were going to come for you,
wouldn't they have done so already?

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:22.397
They're patient. 

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.945
We're all making progress,
and soon we'll be a normal family.

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:31.740
They can slip into your life
without you noticing.

00:00:32.491 --> 00:00:33.242
Why is the door open?

00:00:35.953 --> 00:00:37.037
What is going on?

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:39.248
There's a price to pay.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:49.466
I'm gonna wait right here for them.
And I will protect my family.

